## Also fix while you're here

`server/ai/intelligence-layer/ARCHITECTURE.md` is stale and actively misleading:
it documents V1/V2 hybrid routing, `_execV2`, and profile-driven routing
overrides that were **removed** in the July 2026 consolidation (see the header
comment in `server/ai/aiGateway.js`). Update it to describe what actually runs,
and document the new snapshot/prediction layer.

## Out of scope — do not do these

- Do not add new recommendation generators (there are already 11) or new
  `runtime-v2` modules (there are already 12).
- Do not swap, add, or fine-tune LLM providers.
- Do not refactor `daxService.js` broadly.
- Do not backfill snapshots with synthetic history — the data doesn't exist and
  fabricating it would poison every trend and prediction downstream.

## How to work

Ship the phases **in order, as separate reviewable commits** (don't commit until
I ask). After each phase: run `cd server && npm test`, report what passed and
what failed with real output, and pause for my go-ahead before the next phase.
If a phase turns out to be blocked or a premise is wrong, finish the others and
tell me explicitly what you left out and why.